   Cao, XX (Corresponding Author), Chiba Univ, Grad Sch, Chiba, Japan.
   Gao, Muxing; Cao, Xiaoxiao, Commun Univ Zhejiang, Sch Design \& Art, Dept Prod Design, Hangzhou, Peoples R China.
   Gao, Muxing, Cent Acad Fine Arts, Postdoctoral Stn, Beijing, Peoples R China.
   Cao, Xiaoxiao, Chiba Univ, Grad Sch, Chiba, Japan.
