   for negative-sense RNA viruses. Structure determination of VSV particles
   is particularly challenging because they are polymorphic with different
   helical symmetries. Here, Jenni et al. apply computational
   classification approaches to sort different morphologies, and obtain
   CryoEM reconstructions at 3.5-4.1 A resolution. They show that the
